{"sections":[{"slug":"无穷范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"无穷范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/范畴论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"无穷范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴的理论是同伦论与范畴论的共同推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是以</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为最基本概念的数学中自然出现的范畴概念</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴通常指</span> $(\\infty ,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/n-r-范畴","text":"$(n,r)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">其中有任意高阶的态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但只有至多一阶的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不可逆</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>. $(\\infty ,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的任意两个对象之间的态射构成一个</span> $(\\infty ,0)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">历史上人们发明了多种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴的模型","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">以基于集合论研究无穷范畴</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">人们也常用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于拓扑空间的范畴</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/带弱等价的范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">带弱等价的范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模型范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等等结构来</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">但这些概念都不是无穷范畴的概念本身</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为完备</span> Segal <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></h3>\n<p>$(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴可定义为完备</span> Segal <span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Segal空间","text":"Segal <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出普通范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">无穷</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">是产生所有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">概念的自然场所</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特殊的无穷范畴</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}